{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScramBrawl\u00a0is a silly physics-based party game where you fight as clumsy, half boiled beings. Blast your buddies with yolk missiles, slap them with fish and much more. Scramble your way to victory in hilarious, chaotic brawls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOLK AROUND WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with upto 4 players in local multiplayer or Steam Remote Play Together. Or practise solo against AI eggs.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARGE... AIM... YOLK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything. Charge up your yolk and send eggs flying with a satisfying yolky blast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/e7ca16fa8346e592d7e0010114c21d0b.poster.avif?t=1772223317\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/e7ca16fa8346e592d7e0010114c21d0b.webm?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/e7ca16fa8346e592d7e0010114c21d0b.mp4?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>NO YOLK? NO PROBLEM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything as a weapon, especially fish!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/610dce225c07cedc5b4fa1ce6dae4a17.poster.avif?t=1772223317\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/610dce225c07cedc5b4fa1ce6dae4a17.webm?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/610dce225c07cedc5b4fa1ce6dae4a17.mp4?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EGGSQUISITE PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw, headbutt, swing and fling with eggsquisite egg physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack it out across 6 eggcellently hazardous maps full of\u00a0physics-driven chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/0ffbd63c38a7eacd4adcfc6a99e05c23.poster.avif?t=1772223317\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/0ffbd63c38a7eacd4adcfc6a99e05c23.webm?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/0ffbd63c38a7eacd4adcfc6a99e05c23.mp4?t=1772223317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW DO YOU LIKE YOUR EGGS?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ScramBrawl\u00a0</strong>every egg for them self.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teams</strong> gather your eggy allies and pick a side for Red Vs. Blue battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1</strong>\u00a0go one on one in a high pressure yolk duel.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EGGSPRESS YOURSELF WITH CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in style with a lovely hat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/05d90c635a7e10bc76851bcf0bf8b5a9.poster.avif?t=1772223317\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/05d90c635a7e10bc76851bcf0bf8b5a9.webm?t=1772223317\" type=\"vide